ne concrete deterministic choice, and record that point as an undetermined behavior with a short description. Then compute next_order's output for every probe in probes.json. Write next_order.py and child-result.json.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"Producing the independent implementation and its per-probe outputs is the worker's substantive contribution and the empirical half of the comparison.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"self-check\",\n      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"child\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Re-read next_order.py against spec.md and re-read child-result.json against the deliverable shape. Confirm next_order.py depends only on fields spec.md names (id, priority), that each recorded undetermined behavior is a real point where spec.md permits more than one output, and that per_probe_outputs matches what next_order.py returns. Record the structural check outcome. Non-authoritative.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"The contract requires the verify primitive in any Write-holding topology; a structural self-check before return is the minimal fulfilment.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"return-result\",\n      \"primitive\": \"return\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"executor\": \"child\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Finalize child-result.json and the child ledger, ending with a complete event. Do not attempt to launch or delegate anything.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"The worker's evidence must re-enter the boundary through a defined return locus.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\"source\": \"observe-inputs\", \"target\": \"produce-evidence\", \"relation\": \"observe\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"produce-evidence\", \"target\": \"self-check\", \"relation\": \"verify\", \"requires_response\": true, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false},\n    {\"source\": \"self-check\", \"target\": \"return-result\", \"relation\": \"authorize\", \"requires_response\": false, \"response_changes_parent_state\": false, \"transfers_authority\": false}\n  ],\n  \"ledger_contract\": {\n    \"path\": \"child-ledger.jsonl (child workspace root)\",\n    \"schema\": \"one JSON object per line with event_id, label, actor, timestamp, artifact_refs, metadata; node executions carry metadata.completes_node; the chain ends with a complete event\",\n    \"required_events\": [\n      {\"label\": \"observe\", \"actor\": \"node:observe-inputs\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"observe-inputs\"}},\n      {\"label\": \"propose\", \"actor\": \"node:produce-evidence\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"produce-evidence\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"next_order.py\", \"child-result.json\"]},\n      {\"label\": \"verify\", \"actor\": \"node:self-check\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"self-check\"}},\n      {\"label\": \"return\", \"actor\": \"node:return-result\", \"metadata\": {\"completes_node\": \"return-result\"}, \"artifact_refs\": [\"child-result.json\"]},\n      {\"label\": \"complete\", \"actor\": \"child\", \"metadata\": {\"event_kind\": \"child_complete\"}}\n    ]\n  }\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":720,"cache_read_input_tokens":54026,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":720},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d226a95-1720-4370-b46e-8dc8506b3a3a","uuid":"a18cadd7-63fe-474f-b231-d31069155530","timestamp":"2026-08-09T14:16:20.148Z","request_id":"req_011CdsKHbCxZ9ex4GhukAXmD"}
